name nicematrix
category Package
revision 79680
shortdesc Improve the typesetting of matrices and tabulars with PGF
longdesc This package is based on the package array. It creates PGF/TikZ
longdesc nodes under the cells of the array and uses these nodes to
longdesc provide functionalities to construct tabulars, arrays and
longdesc matrices. Among the features : continuous dotted lines for the
longdesc mathematical matrices; exterior rows and columns (so-called
longdesc border matrices); control of the width of the columns; tools to
longdesc color rows and columns with a good PDF result; blocks of cells;
longdesc tabular notes; etc. The package requires and loads array,
longdesc amsmath, pgfcore, and the module shapes of PGF.
